(text "D5 / IO33: Wi-Fi   D6 / IO38: MQTT   D9 / IO1: Hold\nD11 / IO7: transistor (do not use the XIAO pin map)\nQ1: onsemi 2N3904, pads 1=E, 2=B, 3=C\nJ3: open collector and common GND; NOT an isolated contact\nNo connection to VBUS, VBAT, EN, LDO2, USB or strapping pins." (at 45 145 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)) (uuid d72c999e-1571-50dc-be5d-2c54a8f2d663))
